","statement":"The current user is bound as the caller identity, and the resolved caller membership is carried separately from the target membership.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":742,"endLine":746}]},{"id":"other-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"Resource resolution binds the target user and target active membership in the caller's resolved space, while also resolving the caller membership.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":632,"endLine":662}]},{"id":"other-active-membership-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The resolver accepts the caller and target only when their memberships have active-member roles; the supplied scenario additionally fixes the target as a different member.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":46,"endLine":51},{"sourceId":"src-a88b144abe83d813","startLine":64,"endLine":66}]},{"id":"other-admin-control","kind":"control","statement":"When the target is not the caller, the handler requires the caller membership to have the space administrator role; failure returns before deletion.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":750,"endLine":755}]},{"id":"other-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The protected effect is the store deletion of the resolved target membership, followed by publication of the space change; this path is not reached after the administrator guard denies.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":756,"endLine":763}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]},{"obligationId":"scenario%3Aself-leave::entry%3Adelete-member","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"allow"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared DeleteSpaceMember entry boundary, the caller is authenticated and the caller's own active membership is resolved under the supplied premise. The handler compares targetUser.ID with currentUser.ID; for the self target, isSelf is true, so the separate administrator check for a different target is skipped. The handler then calls the store deletion effect for the resolved membership and publishes the space change if that call succeeds. Thus the source-visible behavior is allow for self-leave, without assuming that the caller is an administrator. No decisive source-external fact is required within this boundary under the accepted premises; the source crop does not establish deployment behavior or repository-wide completeness.","facts":[{"id":"self-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"DeleteSpaceMember requires the current authenticated user and resolves the requested space-member resource before applying the target comparison.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":740,"endLine":748}]},{"id":"self-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds currentUser as the caller identity and receives callerMembership independently from targetUser and targetMembership.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":742,"endLine":746}]},{"id":"self-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"Resource resolution binds the requested space, target user, caller membership, and target active membership.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":632,"endLine":662}]},{"id":"self-active-membership-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The resolver requires an active caller membership and an active target membership; the supplied scenario fixes the target as the caller's own membership.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":46,"endLine":51},{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":659,"endLine":662}]},{"id":"self-exception-control","kind":"control","statement":"The handler sets isSelf from the target and caller IDs and performs the administrator check only when isSelf is false, so self-leave does not require administrator authority.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":750,"endLine":755}]},{"id":"self-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the self exception, the handler invokes store deletion using the resolved target membership and publishes the space change after a successful deletion.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e2ad4ef5bd43e06f","startLine":756,"endLine":763}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":5100,"output":1499,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":71545.3896,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:09:28.441Z"}}
